    {
      "source": "Return the list of MIME types supported by this Encoder. The list may not\napply to every possible target element type and calls to this method should\ntypically be guarded via <a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>canEncode(elementType, null)</code></a>. The list may also exclude MIME types\nsupported only for a specific element type. Alternatively, use\n<a href=\"Encoder.html#getEncodableMimeTypes(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>Encoder.getEncodableMimeTypes(ResolvableType)</code></a> for a more precise list.",
      "translation": "返回此编码器支持的 MIME 类型列表。该列表可能不适用于所有可能的目标元素类型，因此调用此方法通常应通过 <a href=\"Encoder.html#canEncode(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType,org.springframework.util.MimeType)\"><code>canEncode(elementType, null)</code></a> 进行保护。该列表也可能排除仅针对特定元素类型支持的 MIME 类型。或者，使用 <a href=\"Encoder.html#getEncodableMimeTypes(org.springframework.core.ResolvableType)\"><code>Encoder.getEncodableMimeTypes(ResolvableType)</code></a> 获取更精确的列表。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
